From e4441940213eb6eb8353e7808b50533da9fa0a82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:22:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD review completion prompts so reviewed patch-agent
 chats close explicitly

Reviewed patch-agent sessions receive a yes/no completion prompt after review results are recorded. The terminal treats yes/y as local closure while preserving later repeated prompts and reopening the chat when the user types follow-up text.
